    "Apps › Discover Apps › ⋮ › Install via YAML. Paste this. The image comes from Pluck's docker folder, built on the NAS or pushed to your own registry." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apps › Discover Apps › ⋮ › Install via YAML. Füge das hier ein. Das Image stammt aus Plucks Docker-Ordner und wird auf dem NAS gebaut oder in deine eigene Registry gepusht."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apps › Discover Apps › ⋮ › Install via YAML. Pega esto. La imagen sale de la carpeta docker de Pluck, construida en el NAS o subida a tu propio registro."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apps › Discover Apps › ⋮ › Install via YAML. Collez ceci. L’image vient du dossier docker de Pluck, construite sur le NAS ou envoyée vers votre propre registre."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apps › Discover Apps › ⋮ › Install via YAML. Incolla questo. L’immagine viene dalla cartella docker di Pluck, creata sul NAS o inviata al tuo registry."
