    "Compare two photos zoomed together, clipping warnings, colour label keys, undo, snapshots, selective paste, Match Exposure and XMP sidecars for Lightroom and Capture One." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zwei Fotos gemeinsam gezoomt vergleichen, Beschneidungswarnungen, Tasten für Farbetiketten, Widerrufen, Schnappschüsse, selektives Einfügen, Belichtung angleichen und XMP-Filialdateien für Lightroom und Capture One."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compara dos fotos con zoom a la vez, avisos de recorte, teclas para etiquetas de color, deshacer, instantáneas, pegado selectivo, Igualar exposición y archivos XMP para Lightroom y Capture One."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparez deux photos avec zoom lié, alertes d’écrêtage, touches d’étiquettes de couleur, annulation, instantanés, collage sélectif, Égaliser l’exposition et fichiers XMP pour Lightroom et Capture One."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Confronta due foto con zoom insieme, avvisi di clipping, tasti per le etichette colore, annulla, istantanee, incolla selettivo, Uniforma esposizione e file XMP per Lightroom e Capture One."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2枚の写真をズーム連動で比較、クリッピング警告、カラーラベルのキー、取り消し、スナップショット、選択的な貼り付け、露出を揃える、LightroomとCapture One向けのXMPサイドカー。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "두 사진을 함께 확대해 비교, 클리핑 경고, 색상 레이블 키, 실행 취소, 스냅숏, 선택 붙여넣기, 노출 맞추기, Lightroom과 Capture One용 XMP 사이드카."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Twee foto’s samen ingezoomd vergelijken, clippingwaarschuwingen, toetsen voor kleurlabels, ongedaan maken, snapshots, selectief plakken, Belichting gelijkmaken en XMP-bestanden voor Lightroom en Capture One."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compare duas fotos com zoom junto, avisos de recorte, teclas de rótulos de cor, desfazer, instantâneos, colar seletivo, Igualar exposição e arquivos XMP para Lightroom e Capture One."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同步缩放比较两张照片、溢出警告、颜色标签按键、撤销、快照、选择性粘贴、匹配曝光，以及适用于 Lightroom 和 Capture One 的 XMP 附属文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
