            "value" : "所有相机和一台录音机。通过时间码、声音和闪光进行同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every camera and the drone. RED and Blackmagic RAW are read through DaVinci Resolve." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alle Kameras und die Drohne. RED und Blackmagic RAW werden über DaVinci Resolve gelesen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todas las cámaras y el dron. RED y Blackmagic RAW se leen a través de DaVinci Resolve."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toutes les caméras et le drone. RED et Blackmagic RAW sont lus via DaVinci Resolve."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tutte le camere e il drone. RED e Blackmagic RAW vengono letti tramite DaVinci Resolve."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "すべてのカメラとドローン。REDとBlackmagic RAWはDaVinci Resolve経由で読み込みます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "모든 카메라와 드론. RED와 Blackmagic RAW는 DaVinci Resolve를 통해 읽습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elke camera en de drone. RED en Blackmagic RAW worden via DaVinci Resolve gelezen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todas as câmeras e o drone. RED e Blackmagic RAW são lidos pelo DaVinci Resolve."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有机位和无人机。RED 和 Blackmagic RAW 通过 DaVinci Resolve 读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every camera starts from the same neutral point, with profiles, Kelvin white balance and highlights and shadows that recover without halos. Masks, colour mixer, Auto, live histogram and zoom up to 400%. Your originals are never changed." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede Kamera startet am selben neutralen Punkt, mit Profilen, Weißabgleich in Kelvin und Lichtern und Tiefen, die sich ohne Halos zurückholen lassen. Masken, Farbmischer, Auto, Live-Histogramm und Zoom bis 400 %. Deine Originale bleiben unverändert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todas las cámaras parten del mismo punto neutro, con perfiles, balance de blancos en Kelvin y luces y sombras que se recuperan sin halos. Máscaras, mezclador de color, Auto, histograma en vivo y zoom hasta el 400 %. Tus originales nunca se modifican."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chaque appareil part du même point neutre, avec des profils, une balance des blancs en Kelvin et des hautes lumières et ombres récupérées sans halos. Masques, mélangeur de couleurs, Auto, histogramme en direct et zoom jusqu’à 400 %. Vos originaux ne sont jamais modifiés."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ogni fotocamera parte dallo stesso punto neutro, con profili, bilanciamento del bianco in Kelvin e luci e ombre recuperate senza aloni. Maschere, mixer colore, Auto, istogramma dal vivo e zoom fino al 400%. I tuoi originali non vengono mai modificati."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "どのカメラも同じニュートラルな状態から始まり、プロファイル、ケルビンのホワイトバランス、ハローのないハイライトとシャドウの回復に対応。マスク、カラーミキサー、自動補正、ライブヒストグラム、最大400%のズーム。元のファイルは一切変更されません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "모든 카메라가 같은 중립 지점에서 시작하며, 프로파일, 켈빈 화이트 밸런스, 헤일로 없는 하이라이트와 그림자 복원을 제공합니다. 마스크, 색상 믹서, 자동, 실시간 히스토그램, 최대 400% 확대. 원본은 절대 변경되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elke camera begint bij hetzelfde neutrale punt, met profielen, witbalans in Kelvin en hoge lichten en schaduwen die zonder halo’s herstellen. Maskers, kleurmixer, Auto, live histogram en zoom tot 400%. Je originelen worden nooit aangepast."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toda câmera parte do mesmo ponto neutro, com perfis, balanço de branco em Kelvin e realces e sombras recuperados sem halos. Máscaras, mixer de cores, Auto, histograma ao vivo e zoom até 400%. Seus originais nunca são alterados."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有相机都从同一个中性起点开始，提供配置文件、开尔文白平衡，以及无光晕的高光和阴影恢复。蒙版、颜色混合器、自动、实时直方图，缩放最高 400%。原始文件永远不会被更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
