    "In DaVinci Resolve, select the clips in the media pool, choose Link Proxy Media and pick the folder here: Resolve matches the proxies by name. Back on the host Mac, the project uses the originals." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wähle in DaVinci Resolve die Clips im Media Pool, dann „Link Proxy Media“ und diesen Ordner: Resolve ordnet die Proxys nach Namen zu. Auf dem Host-Mac nutzt das Projekt wieder die Originale."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En DaVinci Resolve, selecciona los clips en el Media Pool, elige Link Proxy Media y escoge esta carpeta: Resolve empareja los proxies por nombre. En el Mac anfitrión, el proyecto usa los originales."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans DaVinci Resolve, sélectionnez les plans dans le Media Pool, choisissez Link Proxy Media et ce dossier : Resolve associe les proxys par leur nom. Sur le Mac hôte, le projet utilise les originaux."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In DaVinci Resolve, seleziona le clip nel Media Pool, scegli Link Proxy Media e questa cartella: Resolve abbina i proxy per nome. Sul Mac host, il progetto usa gli originali."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DaVinci Resolveでメディアプールのクリップを選び、「Link Proxy Media」でこのフォルダを選択します。Resolveが名前でプロキシを対応付けます。ホストMacではプロジェクトは元の素材を使います。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DaVinci Resolve의 미디어 풀에서 클립을 선택하고 Link Proxy Media에서 이 폴더를 고르세요. Resolve가 이름으로 프록시를 연결합니다. 호스트 Mac에서는 프로젝트가 원본을 사용합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selecteer in DaVinci Resolve de clips in de Media Pool, kies Link Proxy Media en deze map: Resolve koppelt de proxy’s op naam. Op de host-Mac gebruikt het project weer de originelen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No DaVinci Resolve, selecione os clipes no Media Pool, escolha Link Proxy Media e esta pasta: o Resolve associa os proxies pelo nome. No Mac anfitrião, o projeto usa os originais."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 DaVinci Resolve 的媒体池中选择片段，选择 Link Proxy Media 并选取此文件夹：Resolve 会按名称匹配代理。回到主机 Mac 上，项目会使用原始素材。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
