    "Pluck couldn’t reach DaVinci Resolve. Open DaVinci Resolve Studio and set Preferences › System › General › External scripting using to Local. (The free version of Resolve doesn’t allow this.)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pluck konnte DaVinci Resolve nicht erreichen. Öffne DaVinci Resolve Studio und stelle unter Einstellungen › System › Allgemein › External scripting using auf Local. (Die kostenlose Version von Resolve erlaubt das nicht.)"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pluck no pudo conectar con DaVinci Resolve. Abre DaVinci Resolve Studio y ajusta Preferencias › Sistema › General › External scripting using en Local. (La versión gratuita de Resolve no lo permite)."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pluck n’a pas pu joindre DaVinci Resolve. Ouvrez DaVinci Resolve Studio et réglez Préférences › Système › Général › External scripting using sur Local. (La version gratuite de Resolve ne le permet pas.)"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pluck non è riuscito a raggiungere DaVinci Resolve. Apri DaVinci Resolve Studio e imposta Preferenze › Sistema › Generale › External scripting using su Local. (La versione gratuita di Resolve non lo consente.)"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PluckがDaVinci Resolveに接続できませんでした。DaVinci Resolve Studioを開き、環境設定 › システム › 一般 › External scripting usingを「Local」にしてください（無償版のResolveでは使えません）。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pluck이 DaVinci Resolve에 연결할 수 없습니다. DaVinci Resolve Studio를 열고 환경설정 › 시스템 › 일반 › External scripting using을 Local로 설정하세요. (무료 버전 Resolve에서는 사용할 수 없습니다.)"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pluck kon DaVinci Resolve niet bereiken. Open DaVinci Resolve Studio en zet Voorkeuren › Systeem › Algemeen › External scripting using op Local. (De gratis versie van Resolve staat dit niet toe.)"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Pluck não conseguiu acessar o DaVinci Resolve. Abra o DaVinci Resolve Studio e defina Preferências › Sistema › Geral › External scripting using como Local. (A versão gratuita do Resolve não permite isso.)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pluck 无法连接 DaVinci Resolve。请打开 DaVinci Resolve Studio，并将“偏好设置 › 系统 › 常规 › External scripting using”设为 Local。（免费版 Resolve 不支持。）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
