    },
    "Pluck is now small and focused on downloading, the Library, sharing and converting. Pluck Studio adds the local AI, the editing tools and Edit Anywhere. Switch any time in Settings → General." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pluck ist jetzt klein und auf Downloads, Mediathek, Teilen und Umwandeln fokussiert. Pluck Studio bringt die lokale KI, die Schnittwerkzeuge und Überall bearbeiten mit. Wechsle jederzeit unter Einstellungen → Allgemein."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pluck ahora es pequeño y se centra en descargar, la Biblioteca, compartir y convertir. Pluck Studio añade la IA local, las herramientas de edición y Editar en cualquier lugar. Cambia cuando quieras en Ajustes → General."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pluck est désormais léger et centré sur le téléchargement, la Bibliothèque, le partage et la conversion. Pluck Studio ajoute l’IA locale, les outils de montage et Monter partout. Changez à tout moment dans Réglages → Général."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pluck ora è leggero e si concentra su download, Libreria, condivisione e conversione. Pluck Studio aggiunge l’IA locale, gli strumenti di montaggio e Montaggio ovunque. Cambia quando vuoi in Impostazioni → Generali."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pluck は、ダウンロード、ライブラリ、共有、変換に絞った小さなアプリになりました。Pluck Studio ではローカル AI、編集ツール、どこでも編集が加わります。設定 → 一般でいつでも切り替えられます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이제 Pluck은 다운로드, 보관함, 공유, 변환에 집중한 작은 앱입니다. Pluck Studio에는 로컬 AI, 편집 도구, 어디서나 편집가 더해집니다. 설정 → 일반에서 언제든지 바꿀 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pluck is nu klein en gericht op downloaden, de bibliotheek, delen en omzetten. Pluck Studio voegt de lokale AI, de montagetools en Overal monteren toe. Wissel altijd via Instellingen → Algemeen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Pluck agora é leve e focado em baixar, na Biblioteca, em compartilhar e converter. O Pluck Studio adiciona a IA local, as ferramentas de edição e Editar de qualquer lugar. Troque a qualquer momento em Ajustes → Geral."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pluck 现在小巧专注于下载、资料库、分享和转换。Pluck Studio 增加了本地 AI、剪辑工具和随处剪辑。可随时在“设置 → 通用”中切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pluck is translated into Dutch and follows your Mac’s language." : {
