    "The NAS server doesn’t accept this Mac’s key: Pair Again" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der NAS-Server akzeptiert den Schlüssel dieses Macs nicht: Erneut koppeln"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El servidor del NAS no acepta la clave de este Mac: Volver a vincular"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le serveur du NAS n’accepte pas la clé de ce Mac : Jumeler à nouveau"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il server NAS non accetta la chiave di questo Mac: Abbina di nuovo"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NAS サーバーがこの Mac のキーを受け入れません：再ペアリング"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NAS 서버가 이 Mac의 키를 수락하지 않습니다: 다시 페어링"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De NAS-server accepteert de sleutel van deze Mac niet: Opnieuw koppelen"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O servidor do NAS não aceita a chave deste Mac: Parear de novo"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NAS 服务器不接受此 Mac 的密钥：重新配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The NAS server may not read this folder. In TrueNAS: Datasets › the dataset › Permissions › Edit, Add Item (User apps, Read, Flags Inherit), tick “Apply permissions recursively” and “to child datasets”, then Save Access Control List." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der NAS-Server darf diesen Ordner möglicherweise nicht lesen. In TrueNAS: Datasets › das Dataset › Permissions › Edit, Add Item (User apps, Read, Flags Inherit), „Apply permissions recursively“ und „to child datasets“ ankreuzen, dann Save Access Control List."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puede que el servidor del NAS no pueda leer esta carpeta. En TrueNAS: Datasets › el dataset › Permissions › Edit, Add Item (User apps, Read, Flags Inherit), marca «Apply permissions recursively» y «to child datasets» y luego Save Access Control List."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le serveur du NAS n’a peut-être pas le droit de lire ce dossier. Dans TrueNAS : Datasets › le dataset › Permissions › Edit, Add Item (User apps, Read, Flags Inherit), cochez « Apply permissions recursively » et « to child datasets », puis Save Access Control List."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il server NAS potrebbe non poter leggere questa cartella. In TrueNAS: Datasets › il dataset › Permissions › Edit, Add Item (User apps, Read, Flags Inherit), spunta “Apply permissions recursively” e “to child datasets”, poi Save Access Control List."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NAS サーバーがこのフォルダを読み取れない可能性があります。TrueNAS で Datasets › 該当のデータセット › Permissions › Edit を開き、Add Item（User apps、Read、Flags Inherit）を追加し、「Apply permissions recursively」と「to child datasets」にチェックを入れてから Save Access Control List を押してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NAS 서버가 이 폴더를 읽지 못할 수 있습니다. TrueNAS에서 Datasets › 해당 데이터셋 › Permissions › Edit, Add Item(User apps, Read, Flags Inherit), ‘Apply permissions recursively’와 ‘to child datasets’를 선택한 다음 Save Access Control List."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De NAS-server mag deze map misschien niet lezen. In TrueNAS: Datasets › de dataset › Permissions › Edit, Add Item (User apps, Read, Flags Inherit), vink ‘Apply permissions recursively’ en ‘to child datasets’ aan en kies dan Save Access Control List."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O servidor do NAS talvez não possa ler esta pasta. No TrueNAS: Datasets › o dataset › Permissions › Edit, Add Item (User apps, Read, Flags Inherit), marque “Apply permissions recursively” e “to child datasets” e depois Save Access Control List."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NAS 服务器可能无法读取此文件夹。在 TrueNAS 中：Datasets › 该数据集 › Permissions › Edit，Add Item（User apps、Read、Flags Inherit），勾选“Apply permissions recursively”和“to child datasets”，然后点 Save Access Control List。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The NAS server rejected Pluck’s key" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der NAS-Server hat den Schlüssel von Pluck abgelehnt"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El servidor del NAS rechazó la clave de Pluck"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le serveur du NAS a refusé la clé de Pluck"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il server NAS ha rifiutato la chiave di Pluck"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NAS サーバーが Pluck のキーを拒否しました"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NAS 서버가 Pluck의 키를 거부했습니다"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De NAS-server heeft de sleutel van Pluck geweigerd"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O servidor do NAS rejeitou a chave do Pluck"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NAS 服务器拒绝了 Pluck 的密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The NAS server rejected Pluck’s key. Choose Install again to read the key it runs with, or Pair Again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der NAS-Server hat den Schlüssel von Pluck abgelehnt. Wähle „Erneut installieren“, um den Schlüssel zu lesen, mit dem er läuft, oder „Erneut koppeln“."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El servidor del NAS rechazó la clave de Pluck. Elige Instalar de nuevo para leer la clave con la que funciona, o Volver a vincular."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le serveur du NAS a refusé la clé de Pluck. Choisissez Réinstaller pour lire la clé qu’il utilise, ou Jumeler à nouveau."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il server NAS ha rifiutato la chiave di Pluck. Scegli Installa di nuovo per leggere la chiave con cui funziona, oppure Abbina di nuovo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NAS サーバーが Pluck のキーを拒否しました。「再インストール」を選んで実行中のキーを読み取るか、「再ペアリング」を選んでください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NAS 서버가 Pluck의 키를 거부했습니다. ‘다시 설치’를 선택해 실행 중인 키를 읽거나 ‘다시 페어링’을 선택하세요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De NAS-server heeft de sleutel van Pluck geweigerd. Kies Opnieuw installeren om de sleutel te lezen waarmee hij draait, of Opnieuw koppelen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O servidor do NAS rejeitou a chave do Pluck. Escolha Instalar de novo para ler a chave com que ele funciona, ou Parear de novo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NAS 服务器拒绝了 Pluck 的密钥。请选择“重新安装”读取它正在使用的密钥，或选择“重新配对”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The NAS server runs a version this Pluck can’t talk to. Update it" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der NAS-Server läuft mit einer Version, mit der dieses Pluck nicht kommunizieren kann. Aktualisiere ihn"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El servidor del NAS ejecuta una versión con la que este Pluck no puede comunicarse. Actualízalo"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le serveur du NAS exécute une version avec laquelle ce Pluck ne peut pas communiquer. Mettez-le à jour"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il server NAS esegue una versione con cui questo Pluck non può comunicare. Aggiornalo"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NAS サーバーは、この Pluck と通信できないバージョンで動作しています。アップデートしてください"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NAS 서버가 이 Pluck과 통신할 수 없는 버전으로 실행 중입니다. 업데이트하세요"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De NAS-server draait een versie waarmee deze Pluck niet kan praten. Werk hem bij"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O servidor do NAS executa uma versão com a qual este Pluck não consegue se comunicar. Atualize-o"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NAS 服务器运行的版本无法与此 Pluck 通信。请更新它"
          }
        }
      }
    },
