    "Uses the photo engine. Get it in the Film tab." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nutzt die Foto-Engine. Hol sie im Tab „Film“."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usa el motor de fotos. Consíguelo en la pestaña Película."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utilise le moteur photo. Obtenez-le dans l’onglet Film."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usa il motore foto. Scaricalo nella scheda Pellicola."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "フォトエンジンを使います。「フィルム」タブで入手してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "사진 엔진을 사용합니다. 필름 탭에서 받으세요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gebruikt de foto-engine. Haal die op in het tabblad Film."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usa o motor de fotos. Baixe-o na aba Filme."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要照片引擎，请在“胶片”标签页获取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Using the yt-dlp and ffmpeg installed on this Mac. Keep them current with “brew upgrade yt-dlp ffmpeg”." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es werden yt-dlp und ffmpeg verwendet, die auf diesem Mac installiert sind. Halte sie mit „brew upgrade yt-dlp ffmpeg“ aktuell."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se usan yt-dlp y ffmpeg instalados en este Mac. Mantenlos al día con “brew upgrade yt-dlp ffmpeg”."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utilise yt-dlp et ffmpeg installés sur ce Mac. Gardez-les à jour avec « brew upgrade yt-dlp ffmpeg »."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vengono usati yt-dlp e ffmpeg installati su questo Mac. Tienili aggiornati con “brew upgrade yt-dlp ffmpeg”."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この Mac にインストールされた yt-dlp と ffmpeg を使用しています。「brew upgrade yt-dlp ffmpeg」で最新に保ってください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 Mac에 설치된 yt-dlp와 ffmpeg를 사용 중입니다. ‘brew upgrade yt-dlp ffmpeg’로 최신 상태를 유지하십시오."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pluck gebruikt de yt-dlp en ffmpeg die op deze Mac zijn geïnstalleerd. Houd ze up-to-date met “brew upgrade yt-dlp ffmpeg”."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usando o yt-dlp e o ffmpeg instalados neste Mac. Mantenha-os atualizados com “brew upgrade yt-dlp ffmpeg”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在使用此 Mac 上安装的 yt-dlp 和 ffmpeg。请用“brew upgrade yt-dlp ffmpeg”保持更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
