    "Couldn’t put the original back (%@; %@). It’s safe in “Pluck · Originals to delete”; Resume tries again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Original konnte nicht zurückgelegt werden (%1$@; %2$@). Es ist sicher in „Pluck · Originals to delete“; Fortsetzen versucht es erneut."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo devolver el original (%1$@; %2$@). Está a salvo en «Pluck · Originals to delete»; Reanudar lo vuelve a intentar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impossible de remettre l’original (%1$@ ; %2$@). Il est en sécurité dans « Pluck · Originals to delete » ; Reprendre réessaie."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impossibile rimettere l’originale (%1$@; %2$@). È al sicuro in «Pluck · Originals to delete»; Riprendi riprova."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オリジナルを戻せませんでした（%1$@、%2$@）。「Pluck · Originals to delete」に安全に保管されています。再開でもう一度試します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "원본을 되돌리지 못했습니다(%1$@; %2$@). “Pluck · Originals to delete”에 안전하게 있습니다. 재개하면 다시 시도합니다."
